# The repository root .gitignore globally ignores package-lock.json, but this
# package must commit its lockfile: `npm ci` (run by CI and by T-1-1) refuses to
# start without one, and the pinned dependency tree is part of the build
# contract (AD-25, plan Step 1). Re-include it here for this package only.
# node_modules/ and dist/ stay ignored via the root .gitignore.
!package-lock.json
